; AndSink with a COMPOUND <value> slot. Upstream never inspects the value's TAG: branch 3 just
; folds the raw byte p[clen+1], which here is the arity-2 expr's FIRST CHILD HEADER (0xC1 =
; SymbolSize(1)), so it still emits a result.  Our _redsink_parse_entry demands a Symbol at the
; value slot and returns `nothing`, dropping the whole group => nothing emitted (silent drop).
(m a 6)
(m a 3)
(exec 0 (, (m $c $i)) (O (and (r $n) $n (v $i))))
